WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.700
A small shop in the morning. Tomek wants some bread and milk.

2
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.670
Dzień dobry. Co podać?

3
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.160
Dzień dobry. Poproszę chleb i mleko.

4
00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.910
To ask for something: the polite word, then the thing.

5
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.720
Coś jeszcze?

6
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.290
Nie, dziękuję. Ile to kosztuje?

7
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.800
And this question asks for the price.

8
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.010
Dziewięć złotych.

9
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.500
Czy mogę zapłacić kartą?

10
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.390
Oczywiście.

11
00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.660
Poproszę wodę.

12
00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:42.700
A feminine word ending in a changes its ending here.

13
00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:47.170
Masculine things and neuter words stay the same.

14
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.080
And to ask the price, use this question.

15
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.960
Tomek wants bread. What does he say?

16
00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.160
Poproszę chleb.

17
00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:05.520
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

18
00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:08.520
Poproszę chleb.

19
00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:14.600
He wants to know the price. What does he ask?

20
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.200
Ile to kosztuje?

21
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.560
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

22
00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.960
Ile to kosztuje?

23
00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:32.640
He wants to pay by card. What does he ask?

24
00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:37.480
Czy mogę zapłacić kartą?

25
00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.840
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

26
00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.480
Czy mogę zapłacić kartą?

27
00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:51.040
